  "text_pages": [
    "Ryukoku International House\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n｜International｜Ryukoku University  You, Unlimited\nNeed Help?\nCenter for the Promotion of Global Education\nRyukoku International House\nAddress\n612-0029　4-38 Nishiura-cho, Fukakusa, Fushimi-ku, Kyoto\n※5 minutes on foot to Fukakusa Campus\nMAP\nStations\n5 minutes on foot to Ryukokudai-mae-fukakusa Station (Keihan Line)\n15 minutes on foot to Kuinabashi Station (Subway Karasuma Line)\n10 minutes on foot to Inari Station (Japan Railways)\nRoom Amenities\nDesk, chair, bed　(Twin rooms have a bunk bed), bookshelf, reading light, air conditioner/heater, curtains.\nInternet：Available in your own room\nShared Facilities\nShower rooms/bathrooms, toilet, kitchens, coin-operated laundry equipment.\ncommon spaces, common TV\nCosts\nDeposit\nSingle rooms　80,000 JPY (upon entry only)\nTwin rooms　50,000 JPY (upon entry only)\nRoom Fee\n≪Room Fees for International Students≫\nSingle rooms\n35,000 JPY/Month\nTwin rooms\n23,000 JPY/Month\n≪Amount after deduction of the International Student Scholarship≫\nScholarship Amounts:\nSingle Room (or Twin Room/Single Use): 10,000 JPY/Month\nTwin Room: 5,000 JPY/Month\n≪Room Fees for Japanese Students≫\nSingle rooms\n45,000 JPY/Month\nTwin rooms\n28,000 JPY/Month\nUtilities\nSingle rooms\nMonthly electricity and water charges, 10,000 JPY/Month (fixed rate)\nTwin rooms\nMonthly electricity and water charges, 6,000 JPY/Month (fixed rate)\nInternet Usage Fee\nFree\nBedding Fee\n1,980JPY/Month (fixed rate)\nKakebuton (heavy blanket), Shikibuton　(mattress), pillow, wool blanket, towel blanket and  sheets, kakebuton covers and pillow covers.\nRental Term\n1 semester\n*Exchange Students from Ryukoku University's Partner Universities should refer to the designated move-out date in the \"Ryukoku University Guide for Exchange Students”.\nThe introduction video of each International Student Dormitory, directed by Resident Supporters (Japanese Students), has been completed.\nPagetop"
  ],
